# The store apps' native shell. Its own package.json, node_modules and Xcode /
# Gradle projects have nothing to do with the website build. Anchored with the
# leading slash: a bare "mobile/" would also drop src/components/mobile/, the
# whole phone UI.
/mobile/
# The landing's demo film, local copy (gitignored too): it shows real people's
# photos. A `vercel` CLI deploy from this Mac would otherwise publish it at
# /landing-media/. Every build reads it from Vercel Blob (src/lib/landing/demo-media.ts).
/public/landing-media/
